<title>POLAND: IZOLACJA JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 1.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>IZOLACJA JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 1.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.36 vs   1.17</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.25 vs   1.90</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.80 vs   2.20</p>
<p> Sales		   17.08 vs  12.98</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.37 vs   3.09</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.83 vs   4.72</p>
<p> Operating profit     7.87 vs   5.46</p>
<p> Sales		   62.12 vs  40.95</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish insulation materials maker is</p>
<p>Materialy Izolacyjne Izolacja SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
